CLASS com/charlesproxy/model/class_930 com/charlesproxy/model/ProxyRecordingListenerWithSession
	COMMENT A ProxyRecordingListener bound to one Session, which it returns from getSession(). Attached to a ProxyEvent under the "com.charlesproxy.ProxyManager.RECORDING_LISTENER" attribute and used by the pcap importer. Charles 4's corpus used this name.
